  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 503.21 Prompt Repair and Maintenance Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 503.21 Prompt Repair and Maintenance Required.\n\n(a) Each owner of a PWS shall promptly repair and fully maintain the operational readiness of the PWS.\n\n(b) The actions required by (a) above, shall include:\n\n(1) The preparation and implementation of a preventative maintenance program, following the minimum guidelines established in Env-Dw 504; and\n\n(2) The prompt repair or replacement of PWS components that have failed or are otherwise not performing as intended.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 503) #10465, eff 12-2-13; ss by #14006, eff 6-25-24 (formerly Env-Dw 503.13)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw500.html"
}
